                    <span class="text-[10px] font-black text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest">Leading Offense</span>
                    <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-900/30 text-amber-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
                        <i class="fas fa-bullseye text-sm"></i>
